                <pb facs="0738" n="1698" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1698"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Sackville to the
                            Marquis of Salisbury</hi>.—(<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Received October</hi> 28.)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegraphic]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi>
                        28</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The letter received by me was a political plot of a Republican.</p>
                <p>By yesterday’s mail I have written to explain the situation arising out of the
                    publication of my private reply.</p>
                <p>It will be on account of Presidential election if my recall is demanded.</p>
                <p>Beg to express deep regret at what has occurred.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
